{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Transfer.Wrap_scalar</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Spoc_core","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Transfer","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Wrap_scalar","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Parameters","href":"#parameters","children":[]},{"title":"Signature","href":"#signature","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Packages a backend buffer of a scalar vector as a DEVICE_BUFFER. A buffer that <code>is_zero_copy</code> (Native, Interpreter: the device uses the host array itself) needs no transfer; any other one, OpenCL host-pointer buffers included, goes through its backend's transfers, which synchronise (map/unmap) instead of copying when the buffer aliases the host pointer.</p>","content":"<h2 id=\"parameters\"><a href=\"#parameters\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Parameters</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec parameter anchored\" id=\"argument-1-B\"><a href=\"#argument-1-B\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> </span><span><a href=\"argument-1-B/index.html\">B</a></span><span> : <a href=\"../../../../spoc/Spoc_framework/Framework_sig/module-type-BACKEND/index.html\">Spoc_framework.Framework_sig.BACKEND</a></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"signature\"><a href=\"#signature\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Signature</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-wrap\"><a href=\"#val-wrap\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> wrap : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dev</span>:<a href=\"../../Device/index.html#type-t\">Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">length</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">elem_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">host_link</span>:<a href=\"../../Memory/index.html#type-host_link\">Memory.host_link</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"argument-1-B/Memory/index.html#type-buffer\">B.Memory.buffer</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../../Vector/index.html#type-device_buffer\">Vector.device_buffer</a></span></code></div></div>"}